an be placed at the begin␀negative_cts_offsets␀Use negative CTS offsets (reducing the need for edit lists)␀omit_tfhd_offset␀␀␀␀Omit the base data offset in tfhd atoms␀prefer_icc␀␀␀␀␀␀If writing colr atom prioritise usage of ICC profile if it exists in stream packet side data␀rtphint␀Add RTP hint tracks␀separate_moof␀␀Write separate moof/mdat atoms for each track␀skip_sidx␀Skip writing of sidx atom␀skip_trailer␀␀Skip writing the mfra/tfra/mfro trailer for fragmented files␀use_metadata_tags␀Use mdta atom for metadata.␀write_colr␀␀␀Write colr atom even if the color info is unspecified (Experimental, may be renamed or changed, do not use from scripts)␀write_gama␀Write deprecated gama atom␀hybrid_fragmented␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀For recoverability, write a fragmented file that is converted to non-fragmented at the end.␀min_frag_duration␀Minimum fragment duration␀mov_gamma␀gamma value for gama atom␀rtpflags␀RTP muxer flags␀latm␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Use MP4A-LATM packetization instead of MPEG4-GENERIC for AAC␀rfc2190␀␀␀␀Use RFC 2190 packetization instead of RFC 4629 for H.263␀skip_rtcp␀␀␀␀␀␀Don't send RTCP sender reports␀h264_mode0␀Use mode 0 for H.264 in RTP␀send_bye␀␀Send RTCP BYE packets when finishing␀skip_iods␀Skip writing iods atom.␀use_editlist␀use edit list␀use_stream_ids_as_track_ids␀use stream ids as track ids␀video_track_timescale␀set timescale of all video tracks␀write_btrt␀force or disable writing btrt␀write_prft␀␀␀Write producer reference time box with specified time source␀prft␀pts␀wallclock␀write_tmcd␀force or disable writing tmcd␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀kD␀␀␀kD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀#kD␀␀␀8kD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ð?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀kD␀␀␀kD␀␀␀Ð␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¯kD␀␀␀ÀkD␀␀␀à␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀êkD␀␀␀␀kD␀␀␀À␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀HkD␀␀␀VkD␀␀␀\␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÀÿÿÿßA␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀pkD␀␀␀€kD␀␀␀¸␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÀÿÿÿßA␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀