ce them as IDR frames.␀b_adapt␀When lookahead is enabled, set this to 0 to disable adaptive B-frame decision␀spatial-aq␀set to 1 to enable Spatial AQ␀spatial_aq␀temporal-aq␀␀␀set to 1 to enable Temporal AQ␀temporal_aq␀zerolatency␀␀Set 1 to indicate zero latency operation (no reordering delay)␀nonref_p␀Set this to 1 to enable automatic insertion of non-reference P-frames␀strict_gop␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Set 1 to minimize GOP-to-GOP rate fluctuations␀aq-strength␀␀␀␀␀␀When Spatial AQ is enabled, this field is used to specify AQ strength. AQ strength scale is from 1 (low) - 15 (aggressive)␀cq␀␀␀Set target quality level (0 to 51, 0 means automatic) for constant quality mode in VBR rate control␀aud␀Use access unit delimiters␀bluray-compat␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Bluray compatibility workarounds␀init_qpP␀Initial QP value for P frame␀init_qpB␀Initial QP value for B frame␀init_qpI␀Initial QP value for I frame␀qp␀␀␀Constant quantization parameter rate control method␀qp_cb_offset␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Quantization parameter offset for cb channel␀qp_cr_offset␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Quantization parameter offset for cr channel␀weighted_pred␀␀␀␀␀␀Set 1 to enable weighted prediction␀coder␀Coder type␀cabac␀cavlc␀ac␀vlc␀b_ref_mode␀Use B frames as references␀␀␀B frames will not be used for reference␀each␀␀␀␀Each B frame will be used for reference␀middle␀␀Only (number of B frames)/2 will be used for reference␀a53cc␀␀␀␀Use A53 Closed Captions (if available)␀dpb_size␀Specifies the DPB size used for encoding (0 means automatic)␀multipass␀Set the multipass encoding␀Single Pass␀qres␀␀␀␀␀␀Two Pass encoding is enabled where first Pass is quarter resolution␀fullres␀␀␀␀␀Two Pass encoding is enabled where first Pass is full resolution␀ldkfs␀␀Low delay key frame scale; Specifies the Scene Change frame size increase allowed in case of single frame VBV and CBR␀extra_sei␀Pass on extra SEI data (e.g. a53 cc) to be included in the bitstream␀udu_sei␀␀␀␀Pass on user data unregistered SEI if available␀intra-refresh␀␀␀Use Periodic Intra Refresh instead of IDR frames␀single-slice-intra-refresh␀␀␀␀␀Use single slice intra refresh␀max_slice_size␀␀␀Maximum encoded slice size in bytes␀constrained-encoding␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable constrainedFrame encoding where each slice in the constrained picture is independent of other slices␀lookahead_level␀␀␀␀␀Specifies the lookahead level. Higher level may improve quality at the expense of performance.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀ç9„D␀␀␀Ä©␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀2@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀ÿ9„D␀␀␀:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀:„D␀␀␀:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀:„D␀␀␀ :„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀*:„D␀␀␀/:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀9:„D␀␀␀:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀<:„D␀␀␀:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀?:„D␀␀␀:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀B:„D␀␀␀E:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀Q:„D␀␀␀V:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀e:„D␀␀␀j:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀à9„D␀␀␀y:„D␀␀␀:„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
