y high quality mode␀cbr_hq␀␀␀␀␀Constant bitrate high quality mode␀vbr_hq␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Variable bitrate high quality mode␀rc-lookahead␀Number of frames to look ahead for rate-control␀surfaces␀Number of concurrent surfaces␀Use cbr encoding mode␀2pass␀Use 2pass encoding mode␀gpu␀␀Selects which NVENC capable GPU to use. First GPU is 0, second is 1, and so on.␀any␀␀␀␀␀Pick the first device available␀list␀List the available devices␀rgb_mode␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Configure how nvenc handles packed RGB input.␀yuv420␀Convert to yuv420␀yuv444␀Convert to yuv444␀disabled␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Disables support, throws an error.␀delay␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Delay frame output by the given amount of frames␀no-scenecut␀␀␀␀When lookahead is enabled, set this to 1 to disable adaptive I-frame insertion at scene cuts␀forced-idr␀If forcing keyframes, force them as IDR frames.␀spatial_aq␀set to 1 to enable Spatial AQ␀spatial-aq␀temporal_aq␀set to 1 to enable Temporal AQ␀temporal-aq␀zerolatency␀␀Set 1 to indicate zero latency operation (no reordering delay)␀nonref_p␀Set this to 1 to enable automatic insertion of non-reference P-frames␀strict_gop␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Set 1 to minimize GOP-to-GOP rate fluctuations␀aq-strength␀␀␀␀␀␀When Spatial AQ is enabled, this field is used to specify AQ strength. AQ strength scale is from 1 (low) - 15 (aggressive)␀cq␀␀␀Set target quality level (0 to 51, 0 means automatic) for constant quality mode in VBR rate control␀aud␀Use access unit delimiters␀bluray-compat␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Bluray compatibility workarounds␀init_qpP␀Initial QP value for P frame␀init_qpB␀Initial QP value for B frame␀init_qpI␀Initial QP value for I frame␀qp␀␀␀Constant quantization parameter rate control method␀qp_cb_offset␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Quantization parameter offset for cb channel␀qp_cr_offset␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Quantization parameter offset for cr channel␀weighted_pred␀␀␀␀␀␀Set 1 to enable weighted prediction␀b_ref_mode␀Use B frames as references␀␀␀␀␀␀␀B frames will not be used for reference␀each␀␀␀␀Each B frame will be used for reference␀middle␀␀Only (number of B frames)/2 will be used for reference␀a53cc␀␀␀␀Use A53 Closed Captions (if available)␀s12m_tc␀Use timecode (if available)␀dpb_size␀␀␀␀␀Specifies the DPB size used for encoding (0 means automatic)␀multipass␀Set the multipass encoding␀Single Pass␀qres␀␀␀␀␀␀Two Pass encoding is enabled where first Pass is quarter resolution␀fullres␀␀␀␀␀Two Pass encoding is enabled where first Pass is full resolution␀highbitdepth␀␀␀Enable 10 bit encode for 8 bit input␀ldkfs␀␀␀␀␀␀Low delay key frame scale; Specifies the Scene Change frame size increase allowed in case of single frame VBV and CBR␀extra_sei␀Pass on extra SEI data (e.g. a53 cc) to be included in the bitstream␀udu_sei␀␀␀␀Pass on user data unregistered SEI if available␀intra-refresh␀␀␀Use Periodic Intra Refresh instead of IDR frames␀single-slice-intra-refresh␀␀␀␀␀Use single slice intra refresh␀max_slice_size␀␀␀Maximum encoded slice size in bytes␀constrained-encoding␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable constrainedFrame encoding where each slice in the constrained picture is independent of other slices␀tf_level␀␀␀␀Specifies the strength of the temporal filtering␀lookahead_level␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Specifies the lookahead level. Higher level may improve quality at the expense of performance.␀unidir_b␀Enable use of unidirectional B-Frames.␀split_encode_mode␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Specifies the split encoding mode␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Disabled for all configurations␀Enabled or disabled depending on the preset and tuning info␀forced␀␀␀␀␀␀Enabled with number of horizontal strips selected by the driver␀Enabled with number of horizontal strips forced to 2 when number of NVENCs > 1␀␀Enabled with number of horizontal strips forced to 3 when number of NVENCs > 2␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Àm„D␀␀␀Çm„D␀␀␀Ä©␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀2@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Àm„D␀␀␀ßm„D␀␀␀çm„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Àm„D␀␀␀èm„D␀␀␀ím„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Àm„D␀␀␀ùm„D␀␀␀␀n„D␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Àm„D␀␀␀
