cement␀scenario␀␀A hint to encoder about the scenario for the encoding session␀unknown␀displayremoting␀videoconference␀archive␀livestreaming␀cameracapture␀videosurveillance␀gamestreaming␀remotegaming␀avbr_accuracy␀␀␀␀Accuracy of the AVBR ratecontrol (unit of tenth of percent)␀avbr_convergence␀␀␀␀Convergence of the AVBR ratecontrol (unit of 100 frames)␀skip_frame␀Allow frame skipping␀no_skip␀Frame skipping is disabled␀insert_dummy␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Encoder inserts into bitstream frame where all macroblocks are encoded as skipped␀insert_nothing␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Encoder inserts nothing into bitstream␀brc_only␀skip_frame metadata indicates the number of missed frames before the current frame␀dual_gfx␀␀␀␀␀Prefer processing on both iGfx and dGfx simultaneously␀off␀Disable HyperEncode mode␀on␀␀Enable HyperEncode mode and return error if incompatible parameters during initialization␀adaptive␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable HyperEncode mode or fallback to single GPU if incompatible parameters during initialization␀idr_interval␀Distance (in I-frames) between IDR frames␀begin_only␀␀␀␀Output an IDR-frame only at the beginning of the stream␀load_plugin␀␀␀␀␀A user plugin to load in an internal session␀none␀hevc_sw␀hevc_hw␀load_plugins␀␀A :-separate list of hexadecimal plugin UIDs to load in an internal session␀␀look_ahead_depth␀␀␀Depth of look ahead in number frames, available when extbrc option is enabled␀profile␀main␀main10␀mainsp␀rext␀scc␀tier␀␀Set the encoding tier (only level >= 4 can support high tier)␀high␀gpb␀␀1: GPB (generalized P/B frame); 0: regular P frame␀tile_cols␀␀␀␀Number of columns for tiled encoding␀tile_rows␀␀Number of rows for tiled encoding␀recovery_point_sei␀␀␀␀Insert recovery point SEI messages␀aud␀␀Insert the Access Unit Delimiter NAL␀pic_timing_sei␀␀␀␀␀Insert picture timing SEI with pic_struct_syntax element␀transform_skip␀Turn this option ON to enable transformskip␀int_ref_type␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Intra refresh type. B frames should be set to 0␀vertical␀horizontal␀slice␀int_ref_cycle_size␀␀␀␀Number of frame