␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀help␀Show usage options and exit␀D␀debug␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Debug mode (makes output deterministic)␀o␀output␀Output filename␀nv12␀Input file is NV12␀yv12␀Input file is YV12␀i420␀Input file is I420 (default)␀i422␀Input file is I422␀i444␀Input file is I444␀codec␀Codec to use␀p␀passes␀Number of passes (1/2/3)␀pass␀Pass to execute (1/2/3)␀fpf␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀First pass statistics file name␀limit␀␀␀Stop encoding after n input frames␀skip␀Skip the first n input frames␀good␀Use Good Quality Deadline␀rt␀Use Realtime Quality Deadline␀allintra␀Use all intra mode␀q␀quiet␀Do not print encode progress␀v␀verbose␀Show encoder parameters␀psnr␀␀␀Show PSNR in status line (0: Disable PSNR status line display, 1: PSNR calculated using input bit-depth (default), 2: PSNR calculated using stream bit-depth); takes default option when arguments are not specified␀c␀cfg␀Config file to use␀test-decode␀Test encode/decode mismatch␀fps␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Stream frame rate (rate/scale)␀webm␀␀␀␀␀Output WebM (default when WebM IO is enabled)␀ivf␀Output IVF␀obu␀Output OBU␀q-hist␀␀␀␀␀␀Show quantizer histogram (n-buckets)␀rate-hist␀␀Show rate histogram (n-buckets)␀disable-warnings␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Disable warnings about potentially incorrect encode settings␀y␀disable-warning-prompt␀␀␀Display warnings, but do not prompt user to continue␀b␀bit-depth␀Bit depth for codec␀input-bit-depth␀Bit depth of input␀input-chroma-subsampling-x␀Chroma subsampling x value␀input-chroma-subsampling-y␀Chroma subsampling y value␀u␀usage␀␀␀␀␀Usage profile number to use (0: good, 1: rt, 2: allintra)␀t␀threads␀Max number of threads to use␀profile␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Bitstream profile number to use␀w␀width␀Frame width␀h␀height␀Frame height␀forced_max_frame_width␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Maximum frame width value to force␀forced_max_frame_height␀␀␀␀␀␀Maximum frame height value to force␀stereo-mode␀Stereo 3D video format␀timebase␀Output timestamp precision (fractional seconds)␀global-error-resilient␀␀Enable global error resiliency features␀lag-in-frames␀Max number of frames to lag␀large-scale-tile␀␀␀␀␀␀Large scale tile coding (0: off (default), 1: on (ivf output only))␀monochrome␀␀Monochrome video (no chroma planes)␀full-still-picture-hdr␀␀␀␀␀␀Use full header for still picture␀use-16bit-internal␀Force use of 16-bit pipeline␀drop-frame␀␀␀␀Temporal resampling threshold (buf %)␀resize-mode␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Frame resize mode (0: off (default), 1: fixed, 2: random, 3: dynamic)␀resize-denominator␀Frame resize denominator␀resize-kf-denominator␀Frame resize keyframe denominator␀superres-mode␀Frame super-resolution mode (0: disabled (default), 1: fixed, 2: random, 3: qthresh, 4: auto)␀superres-denominator␀␀␀␀␀␀Frame super-resolution denominator␀superres-kf-denominator␀␀␀␀␀␀Frame super-resolution keyframe denominator␀superres-qthresh␀␀␀␀Frame super-resolution qindex threshold␀superres-kf-qthresh␀␀␀␀␀Frame super-resolution keyframe qindex threshold␀end-usage␀Rate control mode␀target-bitrate␀Bitrate (kbps)␀min-q␀Minimum (best) quantizer␀max-q␀Maximum (worst) quantizer␀undershoot-pct␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Datarate undershoot (min) target (%)␀overshoot-pct␀␀␀␀␀␀Datarate overshoot (max) target (%)␀buf-sz␀Client buffer size (ms)␀buf-initial-sz␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Client initial buffer size (ms)␀buf-optimal-sz␀␀Client optimal buffer size (ms)␀bias-pct␀CBR/VBR bias (0=CBR, 100=VBR)␀minsection-pct␀GOP min bitrate (% of target)␀maxsection-pct␀GOP max bitrate (% of target)␀enable-fwd-kf␀␀Enable forward reference keyframes␀kf-min-dist␀␀Minimum keyframe interval (frames)␀kf-max-dist␀␀Maximum keyframe interval (frames)␀disable-kf␀Disable keyframe placement␀sframe-dist␀S-Frame interval (frames)␀sframe-mode␀S-Frame insertion mode (1..2)␀annexb␀Save as Annex-B␀noise-sensitivity␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Noise sensitivity (frames to blur)␀sharpness␀␀␀␀Bias towards block sharpness in rate-distortion optimization of transform coefficients (0..7), default is 0␀static-thresh␀Motion detection threshold␀auto-alt-ref␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable automatic alt reference frames␀arnr-maxframes␀AltRef max frames (0..15)␀arnr-strength␀AltRef filter strength (0..6)␀tune␀Distortion metric tuned with␀dist-metric␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Distortion metric to use for in-block optimization␀cq-level␀␀␀␀␀Constant/Constrained Quality level␀max-intra-rate␀Max I-frame bitrate (pct)␀cpu-used␀␀␀␀Speed setting (0..6 in good mode, 5..11 in realtime mode, 0..9 in all intra mode)␀row-mt␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable row based multi-threading (0: off, 1: on (default))␀fp-mt␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable frame parallel multi-threading (0: off (default), 1: on)␀tile-columns␀␀␀␀Number of tile columns to use, log2␀tile-rows␀␀␀Number of tile rows to use, log2␀auto-tiles␀␀␀␀␀Enable auto tiles (0: false (default), 1: true)␀enable-tpl-model␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀RDO based on frame temporal dependency (0: off, 1: backward source based); required for deltaq mode␀enable-keyframe-filtering␀␀␀Apply temporal filtering on key frame (0: no filter, 1: filter without overlay (default), 2: filter with overlay - experimental, may break random access in players)␀tile-width␀Tile widths (comma separated)␀tile-height␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Tile heights (command separated)␀lossless␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Lossless mode (0: false (default), 1: true)␀enable-cdef␀Enable the constrained directional enhancement filter (0: false, 1: true (default), 2: disable for non-reference frames)␀enable-restoration␀␀␀␀␀Enable the loop restoration filter (0: false (default in realtime mode), 1: true (default in non-realtime mode))␀enable-rect-partitions␀Enable rectangular partitions (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-ab-partitions␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable ab partitions (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-1to4-partitions␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable 1:4 and 4:1 partitions (0: false, 1: true (default))␀min-partition-size␀␀Set min partition size (4:4x4, 8:8x8, 16:16x16, 32:32x32, 64:64x64, 128:128x128); with 4k+ resolutions or higher speed settings, min partition size will have a minimum of 8␀max-partition-size␀Set max partition size (4:4x4, 8:8x8, 16:16x16, 32:32x32, 64:64x64, 128:128x128)␀enable-dual-filter␀␀␀␀␀Enable dual filter (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-chroma-deltaq␀␀␀Enable chroma delta quant (0: false (default), 1: true)␀enable-intra-edge-filter␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable intra edge filtering (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-order-hint␀␀␀␀␀Enable order hint (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-tx64␀␀␀␀␀Enable 64-pt transform (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-flip-idtx␀␀␀Enable extended transform type (0: false, 1: true (default)) including FLIPADST_DCT, DCT_FLIPADST, FLIPADST_FLIPADST, ADST_FLIPADST, FLIPADST_ADST, IDTX, V_DCT, H_DCT, V_ADST, H_ADST, V_FLIPADST, H_FLIPADST␀enable-rect-tx␀␀␀Enable rectangular transform (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-dist-wtd-comp␀Enable distance-weighted compound (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-masked-comp␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable masked (wedge/diff-wtd) compound (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-onesided-comp␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable one sided compound (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-interintra-comp␀␀Enable interintra compound (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-smooth-interintra␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable smooth interintra mode (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-diff-wtd-comp␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable difference-weighted compound (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-interinter-wedge␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable interinter wedge compound (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-interintra-wedge␀␀Enable interintra wedge compound (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-global-motion␀␀␀␀␀Enable global motion (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-warped-motion␀Enable local warped motion (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-filter-intra␀␀␀␀Enable filter intra prediction mode (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-smooth-intra␀␀␀Enable smooth intra prediction modes (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-paeth-intra␀␀␀Enable Paeth intra prediction mode (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-cfl-intra␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable chroma from luma intra prediction mode (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-directional-intra␀␀␀␀Enable directional intra prediction modes (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-diagonal-intra␀␀␀Enable diagonal (D45 to D203) intra prediction modes, which are a subset of directional modes; has no effect if enable-directional-intra is 0 (0: false, 1: true (default))␀force-video-mode␀␀␀␀Force video mode even for a single frame (0: false (default), 1: true)␀enable-obmc␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable OBMC (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-overlay␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable coding overlay frames (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-palette␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable palette prediction mode (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-intrabc␀␀␀␀␀Enable intra block copy prediction mode (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-angle-delta␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable intra angle delta (0: false, 1: true (default))␀disable-trellis-quant␀␀␀␀Disable trellis optimization of quantized coefficients (0: false 1: true  2: true for rd search 3: true for estimate yrd search (default))␀enable-qm␀␀␀␀Enable quantisation matrices (0: false (default), 1: true)␀qm-min␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Min quant matrix flatness (0..15), default is 8␀qm-max␀␀Max quant matrix flatness (0..15), default is 15␀reduced-tx-type-set␀␀␀␀Use reduced set of transform types␀use-intra-dct-only␀Use DCT only for INTRA modes␀use-inter-dct-only␀Use DCT only for INTER modes␀use-intra-default-tx-only␀␀␀␀Use Default-transform only for INTRA modes␀quant-b-adapt␀Use adaptive quantize_b␀coeff-cost-upd-freq␀␀␀␀Update freq for coeff costs. 0: SB, 1: SB Row per Tile, 2: Tile, 3: Off␀mode-cost-upd-freq␀␀␀␀␀␀Update freq for mode costs. 0: SB, 1: SB Row per Tile, 2: Tile, 3: Off␀mv-cost-upd-freq␀Update freq for mv costs. 0: SB, 1: SB Row per Tile, 2: Tile, 3: Off␀dv-cost-upd-freq␀␀␀Update freq for dv costs. 0: SB, 1: SB Row per Tile, 2: Tile, 3: Off␀num-tile-groups␀␀␀␀Maximum number of tile groups, default is 1␀mtu-size␀␀␀␀MTU size for a tile group, default is 0 (no MTU targeting), overrides maximum number of tile groups␀timing-info␀Signal timing info in the bitstream (model only works for no hidden frames, no super-res yet):␀partition-info-path␀␀␀␀␀␀Partition information read and write path␀enable-rate-guide-deltaq␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable rate guide deltaq (1), by default off (0). It requires --deltaq-mode=3. If turned on, it requires an input file specified by --rate-distribution-info.␀rate-distribution-info␀␀␀␀Rate distribution information input.It requires --enable-rate-guide-deltaq=1.␀film-grain-test␀␀␀Film grain test vectors (0: none (default), 1: test-1  2: test-2, ... 16: test-16)␀film-grain-table␀␀␀␀␀Path to file containing film grain parameters␀denoise-noise-level␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Amount of noise (from 0 = don't denoise, to 50)␀denoise-block-size␀␀␀␀␀␀Denoise block size (default = 32)␀enable-dnl-denoising␀␀Apply denoising to the frame being encoded when denoise-noise-level is enabled (0: false, 1: true (default))␀enable-ref-frame-mvs␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable temporal mv prediction (default is 1)␀frame-parallel␀␀␀␀␀Enable frame parallel decodability features (0: false (default), 1: true)␀error-resilient␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable error resilient features (0: false (default), 1: true)␀aq-mode␀␀␀Adaptive quantization mode (0: off (default), 1: variance 2: complexity, 3: cyclic refresh)␀deltaq-mode␀Delta qindex mode (0: off, 1: deltaq objective (default), 2: deltaq placeholder, 3: key frame visual quality, 4: user rating based visual quality optimization); requires --enable-tpl-model=1␀deltaq-strength␀␀Deltaq strength for --deltaq-mode=4 (%)␀delta-lf-mode␀␀␀Enable delta-lf-mode (0: off (default), 1: on)␀frame-boost␀␀␀␀␀␀Enable frame periodic boost (0: off (default), 1: on)␀gf-cbr-boost␀␀␀␀␀␀Boost for Golden Frame in CBR mode (pct)␀max-inter-rate␀Max P-frame bitrate (pct)␀min-gf-interval␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Min gf/arf frame interval (default 0, indicating in-built behavior)␀max-gf-interval␀␀␀␀␀Max gf/arf frame interval (default 0, indicating in-built behavior)␀gf-min-pyr-height␀␀␀Min height for GF group pyramid structure (0 (default) to 5)␀gf-max-pyr-height␀␀Maximum height for GF group pyramid structure (0 to 5 (default))␀max-reference-frames␀␀␀Maximum number of reference frames allowed per frame (3 to 7 (default))␀reduced-reference-set␀␀␀Use reduced set of single and compound references (0: off (default), 1: on)␀target-seq-level-idx␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Target sequence level index. Possible values are in the form of "ABxy". AB: Operating point (OP) index, xy: Target level index for the OP. E.g. "0" means target level index 0 (2.0) for the 0th OP, "1019" means target level index 19 (6.3) for the 10th OP.␀min-cr␀␀␀Set minimum compression ratio. Take integer values. Default is 0. If non-zero, encoder will try to keep the compression ratio of each frame to be higher than the given value divided by 100.␀color-primaries␀␀␀Color primaries (CICP) of input content:␀transfer-characteristics␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Transfer characteristics (CICP) of input content:␀matrix-coefficients␀␀␀Matrix coefficients (CICP) of input content:␀chroma-sample-position␀␀␀␀␀The chroma sample position when chroma 4:2:0 is signaled:␀tune-content␀Tune content type␀cdf-update-mode␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀CDF update mode for entropy coding (0: no CDF update, 1: update CDF on all frames (default), 2: selectively update CDF on some frames)␀sb-size␀Superblock size to use␀set-tier-mask␀␀␀␀␀Set bit mask to specify which tier each of the 32 possible operating points conforms to. Bit value 0 (default): Main Tier, 1: High Tier.␀use-fixed-qp-offsets␀␀␀Enable fixed QP offsets for frames at different levels of the pyramid. Selected automatically from --cq-level if --fixed-qp-offsets is not provided. If this option is not specified (default), offsets are adaptively chosen by the encoder.␀fixed-qp-offsets␀␀Set fixed QP offsets for frames at different levels of the pyramid. Comma-separated list of 5 offsets for keyframe, ALTREF, and 3 levels of internal alt-refs. If this option is not specified (default), offsets are adaptively chosen by the encoder.␀vbr-corpus-complexity-lap␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Set average corpus complexity per mb for single pass VBR using lap. (0..10000), default is 0␀fwd-kf-dist␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Set distance between forward keyframes. A value of -1 (default) means no repetitive forward keyframes.␀enable-tx-size-search␀␀␀␀Enable transform size search to find the best size for each block. If false, transforms always have the largest possible size (0: false, 1: true (default)). Ignored in non rd pick mode in real-time coding.␀loopfilter-control␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Control loop filtering (0: Loopfilter disabled for all frames, 1: Enable loopfilter for all frames (default), 2: Disable loopfilter for non-reference frames, 3: Disable loopfilter for frames with low motion)␀two-pass-input␀␀The input file for the second pass for three-pass encoding␀two-pass-output␀␀␀␀␀␀The output file for the first two passes for three-pass encoding␀two-pass-width␀The width of two-pass-input␀two-pass-height␀The height of two-pass-input␀spf␀second-pass-log␀Log file from second pass␀auto-intra-tools-off␀␀␀␀␀Automatically turn off several intra coding tools for allintra mode; only in effect if --deltaq-mode=3␀strict-level-conformance␀When set to 1, exit the encoder when it fails to encode to a given target level␀kf-max-pyr-height␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Maximum height of pyramid structure used for the GOP starting with a key frame (-1 to 5). When set to -1 (default), it does not have any effect. The actual maximum pyramid height will be the minimum of this value and the value of gf_max_pyr_height.␀sb-qp-sweep␀␀␀␀When set to 1, enable the superblock level qp sweep for a given lambda to minimize the rdcost.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ ºåD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¥ºåD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÁºåD␀␀␀ÃºåD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÐºåD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀øºåD␀␀␀úºåD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀)»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀.»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀A»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀F»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀c»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀h»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀{»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀€»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀“»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀™»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¦»åD␀␀␀¨»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¯»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀È»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Í»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀å»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ð»åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀@¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀^¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀c¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀}¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀€¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ž¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀§¼åD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀º¼å