 RD strength must be between 0 and 4␀␀␀␀␀Invalid Recursion skip mode. Valid modes 0,1,2␀␀Minimum edge density percentage for a CU should be an integer between 0 to 100␀␀Lookahead depth must be greater than the max consecutive bframe count␀␀␀bframe count should be greater than zero␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀max consecutive bframe count must be 16 or smaller␀␀␀␀␀␀Lookahead depth must be less than 256␀␀␀Lookahead slices must between 0 and 16␀Aq-Mode is out of range␀Aq-Strength is out of range␀␀␀␀␀␀qp adaptation range is out of range␀␀␀␀␀deblocking filter tC offset must be in the range of -6 to +6␀␀␀␀deblocking filter Beta offset must be in the range of -6 to +6␀␀Psy-rd strength must be between 0 and 5.0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Psy-rdoq strength must be between 0 and 50.0␀␀␀␀WaveFrontSynchro cannot be negative␀␀␀␀␀Sample Aspect Ratio must be 0-16 or 255␀Sample Aspect Ratio width must be greater than 0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Sample Aspect Ratio height must be greater than 0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Video Format must be component, pal, ntsc, secam, mac or unknown␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Color Primaries must be unknown, bt709, bt470m, bt470bg, smpte170m, smpte240m, film, bt2020, smpte-st-428, smpte-rp-431 or smpte-eg-432␀Transfer Characteristics must be unknown, bt709, bt470m, bt470bg, smpte170m, smpte240m, linear, log100, log316, iec61966-2-4, bt1361e, iec61966-2-1, bt2020-10, bt2020-12, smpte-st-2084, smpte-st-428 or arib-std-b67␀␀Matrix Coefficients must be unknown, bt709, fcc, bt470bg, smpte170m, smpte240m, gbr, ycgco, bt2020nc, bt2020c, smpte-st-2085, chroma-nc, chroma-c or ictcp␀␀␀␀␀␀Chroma Sample Location Type Top Field must be 0-5␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Chroma Sample Location Type Bottom Field must be 0-5␀␀␀␀Default Display Window Left Offset must be 0 or greater␀Default Display Window Right Offset must be 0 or greater␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Default Display Window Top Offset must be 0 or greater␀␀Default Display Window Bottom Offset must be 0 or greater␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Valid quality based range: -qpBDOffsetY to 51␀␀␀Valid adaptive b scheduling values 0 - none, 1 - fast, 2 - full␀Valid Logging l